Cell["\<\
The six geodesics from the centre of a grid to a vertex two steps up and two \
across, as a density: both end points are covered six times, the middle \
vertex four times. Each vertex is drawn as large as its mass.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"f57280a0-04b2-4081-b40e-6ccf6a02b62c"],

